# Weekly algo-trading run -- crontab example (Phase 2)
#
# Install (edit PROJECT_DIR first, then):
#   crontab scripts/crontab.example
#
# Runs every Monday at 08:00 America/New_York, before the US open.
# The script itself logs to logs/weekly_YYYY-MM-DD.log; cron output is
# discarded because the script redirects everything to the log file.
#
# NOTE: no live cron job is installed by this project -- this file is
# documentation only. Install it deliberately if you want the weekly run.

# 0 8 * * 1 cd PROJECT_DIR && ./scripts/weekly_run.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
